                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Interpellation, of Mr. Cisa
                        respecting the reported sale of government slaves on embargoed estates in
                        Cuba. Congress of deputies, December</hi> 9, 1872.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract from La Gaceta de Madrid.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cisa</hi>. I have read in
                    the Correspondencia that it is proposed to sell the slaves taken from the Cuban
                    insurgents; and as this would be a serious affair, I wish to know if it is
                    really true?</p>
                <p>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vice-President</hi>. (Mr.
                        Mosquera.) It is doubtless untrue, still the government
                    will be informed of your inquiry.</p>
                <p>* * * * * * *</p>
            </div>
